t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ferwater</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Illumine Desings</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$725</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Spin</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.26.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">July 17th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The Turntable is found in <a href=\"/wiki/Illumine_Designs\" title=\"Illumine Designs\">Illumine Designs</a> and can be bought for $725.\n</p><p>\nIt spins and makes items and players on it spin too.</p><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/22/Turntableloop.gif/revision/latest?cb=20230719144025\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A loop of the turntable rotating an item\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/22/Turntableloop.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20230719144025\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"154\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Turntableloop.gif\" data-image-key=\"Turntableloop.gif\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Turntableloop.gif\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">A loop of the turntable rotating an item</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p><br clear=\"all\" />\n</p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Automation\">Automation</span></h3>\n<p>Normally Items that stay still for a certain amount of time eventually anchor thus no longer being affected by gravity, for loading items into crates this causes items that aren't <a href=\"/wiki/Snow_Tree\" title=\"Snow Tree\">slippery</a> to stack and get the crate stuck, the Turntable effectively reduces the chance of this happening by constantly moving the crates and its contents leading to new items falling into different areas of said crate.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4a/CrateAutoLoader.gif/revision/latest?cb=20240524203548\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A Turntable being used to load Planks into a \" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"144\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"CrateAutoLoader.gif\" data-image-key=\"CrateAutoLoader.gif\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4a/CrateAutoLoader.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20240524203548\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4a/CrateAutoLoader.gif/revision/latest?cb=20240524203548\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A Turntable being used to load Planks into a \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4a/CrateAutoLoader.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20240524203548\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"144\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"CrateAutoLoader.gif\" data-image-key=\"CrateAutoLoader.gif\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4a/CrateAutoLoader.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20240524203548\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:CrateAutoLoader.gif\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">A Turntable being used to load Planks into a <a href=\"/wiki/Large_Crate\" title=\"Large Crate\">Large Crate</a></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901225111\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 66/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 61/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019433/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.919      1 Templat